            "category": "Custom Sizing",
            "question": "Can I order a custom size mat?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! Most of our commercial barrier mat ranges can be manufactured to your exact dimensions. Specify width and length to the millimeter for a seamless architectural entrance fit.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Maintenance",
            "question": "How do I clean and maintain my barrier mat?",
            "answer": "<p>Daily vacuuming removes dry surface dirt. For deeper cleaning, our mats are compatible with injection-extraction cleaning equipment or mild shampoo washing under running water.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Durability",
            "question": "What is the expected lifespan in high-traffic commercial areas?",
            "answer": "<p>Our commercial-grade matting systems are built for endurance. In busy hotel or corporate lobbies, you can expect 5–7 years of peak performance with regular maintenance.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        }
